MODULE: AbandonClearsOtherAlias
TARGET: IndependentAliases
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: rollback clears every logical alias's retained-copy fence
PERTURBS: Abandon

--- FIND
        /\ redirect' = IF alias[l] = source[l] /\ owner[l][source[l]] = token[l]
                        THEN [redirect EXCEPT ![l][source[l]] = None] ELSE redirect
--- REPLACE
        /\ redirect' = [a \in Aliases |-> [p \in Copies |-> None]]
--- END
